          "summary": "CREATE DATABASE, CREATE USER, then GRANT — in that order.",
          "body": "<h2>Database</h2><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">CREATE DATABASE note_mgmnt\n  CHARACTER SET utf8mb4\n  COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;</code></pre><h2>User and grants</h2><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">CREATE USER 'app'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'change-me';\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON note_mgmnt.* TO 'app'@'%';\nFLUSH PRIVILEGES;</code></pre><p>Use <code>'app'@'localhost'</code> instead of <code>%</code> when the app runs on the database host.</p>",
